  "bodyHash": "60ef83a5f47ee7be",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">新增了储能细胞，允许您在ME网络中存储能量（FE）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/413/fe_cells_new.png\" width=\"664\" height=\"226\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用通量访问器与ME网络中存储的能量进行交互。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/414/flux_accessor_new.png\" width=\"651\" height=\"415\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">最大规格的细胞可存储超过200万亿FE！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/415/large_cell_new.png\" width=\"624\" height=\"255\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以在终端直接查看能量存储量，并为物品进行充放电操作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/906/416/terminal_new.png\" width=\"803\" height=\"435\"></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
